{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilith is a young Shadow that wants to be a Light. She embarks on a journey to learn how Light is made but is about to find out a horrible secret. Will you help her turn the tides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover items and solve riddles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Puzzle game where you explore, experiment and solve riddles and puzzles to progress the story. Discover unique abilities and items like the Shadow Harp and Twilight Mirror and use them under the proper conditions to move forward in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between the Shadow Cave, the Sky Plains, the Sun Palace and Sky Town to learn more about the world and story of the game and also find items that will help you in your quest! Meet unique characters with their own hopes and dreams and try to help them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4153560?t=1762876368","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4153560?t=1762876368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153560/ed8b84ac0fd1233c5a3166582852a508ed415115/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762876368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153560/ed8b84ac0fd1233c5a3166582852a508ed415115/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762876368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilith is a young Shadow that wants to be a Light. She embarks on a journey to learn how Light is made but is about to find out a horrible secret. Will you help her turn the tides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover items and solve riddles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Puzzle game where you explore, experiment and solve riddles and puzzles to progress the story. Discover unique abilities and items like the Shadow Harp and Twilight Mirror and use them under the proper conditions to move forward in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between the Shadow Cave, the Sky Plains, the Sun Palace and Sky Town to learn more about the world and story of the game and also find items that will help you in your quest! Meet unique characters with their own hopes and dreams and try to help them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Stavros Aeneas Kokkineas"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153560/32b46db19e78a907f42e4a6e647aea8c77628e74/header.jpg?t=1762876368","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS / Bazzite Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060  / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS / Bazzite Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060 / AMD Radeon 5600XT</li></ul>"